## Database schema

Keys, column types, money, time, lifecycles and migration discipline follow
`.standards/plugins/schema/skills/relational-schema/references/spec.md`, and this project's own
choices are in `schema-conventions.toml`. Read both before writing a migration or altering a table.

Two that are costly to get wrong: a migration that has run anywhere real is finished and is never
edited or consolidated into, and a migration reads nothing it does not carry. `/schema check` runs
the conformance checker against the live catalogue.
